<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Kahambu Foundation | Restoring Hope, Empowering Lives</title>
<meta name="description" content="Kahambu Foundation supports children with disabilities and vulnerable families in Kigo, Mutungo, Wakiso District, Uganda. Donate beds, wheelchairs, food and medicine.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@600;800&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--green:#1f4d3a;--deep:#123528;--gold:#f2b632;--teal:#2a7f8e;--mint:#f1f7f3;--ink:#1b2a24;--white:#fff}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:'Source Sans 3',Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.65;font-size:18px;background:var(--white)}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',Georgia,sans-serif;line-height:1.15;color:var(--deep)}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
a{color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:3px}
.wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 22px}
section{padding:72px 0}
h2{font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px);margin-bottom:14px}
.lead{max-width:62ch;margin-bottom:34px}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--gold);color:var(--deep);font-weight:600;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;border:0;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
.btn:hover{background:#ffc94d}
.btn.alt{background:transparent;color:#fff;border:2px solid #fff;margin-left:8px}
header{position:sticky;top:0;background:var(--deep);z-index:10}
nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;padding:12px 22px;max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto}
nav b{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;color:#fff;font-size:20px}
nav div a{color:#dfeee5;text-decoration:none;margin-left:16px;font-size:16px}
nav div a:hover{color:var(--gold)}
.hero{background:var(--green);color:#fff;padding:64px 0}
.hero .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:40px;align-items:center}
.hero h1{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(36px,6vw,62px);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:18px}
.hero p{max-width:46ch;margin-bottom:26px;color:#e6f2ea}
.hero img{border-radius:22px;border:6px solid var(--gold);aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;width:100%}
.mint{background:var(--mint)}
.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px}
.box{background:#fff;border-left:6px solid var(--teal);padding:24px;border-radius:0 14px 14px 0}
.box h3{margin-bottom:8px}
.goals{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px}
.goals div{border-top:4px solid var(--gold);padding-top:12px}
.goals h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:4px}
.motto{background:var(--deep);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:38px 22px}
.motto p{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(22px,3.4vw,34px);font-weight:800;color:var(--gold)}
.needs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-bottom:30px}
.needs span{background:var(--gold);color:var(--deep);font-weight:600;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:999px}
.gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}
.gallery img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/4;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px}
.team{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:26px}
.team img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover;object-position:top;border-radius:50%;margin-bottom:12px}
.team h3{font-size:19px}
.team p{color:var(--teal);font-weight:600;font-size:16px}
.donate{background:var(--green);color:#fff}
.donate h2{color:#fff}
.amounts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:22px 0}
.amounts button{background:#fff;color:var(--deep);border:3px solid transparent;font:inherit;font-weight:600;font-size:22px;padding:12px 26px;border-radius:14px;cursor:pointer}
.amounts button[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:var(--gold);background:#fff6dc}
.amounts input{width:150px;font:inherit;font-size:20px;padding:12px;border-radius:14px;border:3px solid transparent}
.pay{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border-radius:16px;padding:26px;margin-top:10px}
.pay h3{margin-bottom:6px}
.pay dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:6px 18px;margin:12px 0 18px}
.pay dt{font-weight:600}
#msg{margin:10px 0 18px;font-weight:600;color:var(--green)}
.note{font-size:15px;margin-top:14px;opacity:.85}
footer{background:var(--deep);color:#cfe3d7;padding:36px 0;text-align:center;font-size:16px}
footer a{color:var(--gold)}
@media(max-width:760px){.hero .wrap,.two,.goals{grid-template-columns:1fr}.gallery,.team{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.btn.alt{margin:10px 0 0}nav div{display:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><nav><b>Kahambu Foundation</b><div><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#children">Our children</a><a href="#team">Team</a><a href="#donate">Donate</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></div></nav></header>

<main>
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap">
<div>
<h1>Restoring hope. Empowering lives.</h1>
<p>We stand with children with disabilities, orphans and vulnerable families in Uganda, and remind them that they are not forgotten.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#donate">Donate now</a><a class="btn alt" href="#about">Who we are</a>
</div>
<img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Children supported by Kahambu Foundation with staff and visitors">
</div></section>

<section id="about"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Who we are</h2>
<p class="lead">The Kahambu Foundation exists to stand with people facing difficult circumstances. We meet their physical and emotional needs, and strengthen them through prayer, encouragement, counselling and community support.</p>
<div class="two">
<div class="box"><h3>Our vision</h3><p>A compassionate and empowered community where vulnerable families, orphans, children with disabilities and refugees live with dignity, hope and love, and have the opportunity to build a better future.</p></div>
<div class="box"><h3>Our mission</h3><p>To support and empower vulnerable people and families with their regular needs, food assistance, spiritual and prayer-based empowerment, counselling, encouragement and other practical support that restores hope and promotes self-reliance.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="mint"><div class="wrap">
<h2>What we work towards</h2>
<p class="lead">Four objectives guide everything we do.</p>
<div class="goals">
<div><h3>Support vulnerable families</h3><p>Regular assistance for families facing poverty, hardship and other difficult circumstances.</p></div>
<div><h3>Mobilize community support</h3><p>Working with individuals, churches, organisations, partners, donors and stakeholders to answer the needs of vulnerable communities.</p></div>
<div><h3>Create a culture of compassion</h3><p>Inspiring people and communities to serve others, share what they have and stand together with those in hardship.</p></div>
<div><h3>Promote self-reliance</h3><p>Giving families skills, knowledge and opportunities to become more independent and improve their livelihoods.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<div class="motto"><p>Restoring hope, empowering lives and humanity.</p></div>

<section id="children"><div class="wrap">
<h2>The children we support</h2>
<p class="lead">Many of the children in our care live with disabilities. They need your help with the basics they cannot do without:</p>
<div class="needs"><span>Beds</span><span>Wheelchairs</span><span>Food</span><span>Medicine and treatment</span><span>Clothes</span></div>
<div class="gallery">
<img loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Children and a caregiver receiving a donation">
<img loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="A child standing on a hospital-style veranda with others nearby">
<img loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="A child crawling across the veranda floor">
<img loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="A child resting on a bed with pink bedding">
<img loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="A smiling child in a wheelchair in front of a painted mural">
<img loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Children, staff and visitors gathered around a donated washing machine">
</div></div></section>

<section class="mint" id="team"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Meet our team</h2>
<p class="lead">The people who care for the children and make sure every gift reaches them.</p>
<div class="team">
<div><img loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Rose Nyondo Mbambu"><h3>Rose Nyondo Mbambu</h3><p>Executive Director</p></div>
<div><img loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Joseph Itongwa Ngolombe Sadjo"><h3>Joseph Itongwa Ngolombe Sadjo</h3><p>Field Officer Coordinator</p></div>
<div><img loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Kalibaala Vicent"><h3>Kalibaala Vicent</h3><p>Finance Manager</p></div>
<div><img loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Moustapha Mulonda Kibukila"><h3>Moustafa Mulongo Kibukila</h3><p>Program Manager</p></div>
<div><img loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Masika Olivia"><h3>Masika Olivia</h3><p>Administrator</p></div>
<div><img loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Alain Maroy Beringenine"><h3>Alain Maroy Beringenine</h3><p>Public Relations</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="donate" id="donate"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Give a child hope today</h2>
<p class="lead">Every gift goes towards food, medicine, clothes, beds and wheelchairs for children with disabilities. Choose an amount, then send it by bank transfer and tell us on WhatsApp so we can thank you.</p>
<div class="amounts" role="group" aria-label="Choose a donation amount">
<button type="button" data-a="10" aria-pressed="false">$10</button>
<button type="button" data-a="20" aria-pressed="false">$20</button>
<button type="button" data-a="50" aria-pressed="false">$50</button>
<button type="button" data-a="100" aria-pressed="false">$100</button>
<input id="other" type="number" min="1" placeholder="Other $" aria-label="Other amount in US dollars">
</div>
<div class="pay">
<h3>How to give</h3>
<p id="msg">Choose an amount above.</p>
<dl>
<dt>Bank</dt><dd>Centenary Bank</dd>
<dt>Account name</dt><dd>Rose Nyondo Mbambu</dd>
<dt>Account number</dt><dd>3202363905</dd>
<dt>WhatsApp / call</dt><dd>0778118580</dd>
</dl>
<a class="btn" id="wa" href="https://wa.me/256778118580" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Tell us on WhatsApp</a>
<p class="note">Please confirm the account details by phone before sending your first gift.</p>
</div>
</div></section>

<section id="contact"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Contact us</h2>
<p class="lead">Visit us, write to us, or call to ask how you can help.</p>
<div class="two">
<div class="box"><h3>Office</h3><p>Kigo, Mutungo<br>Wakiso District, Uganda</p></div>
<div class="box"><h3>Reach us</h3><p>Email: <a href="mailto:kahambufoundation26@gmail.com">kahambufoundation26@gmail.com</a><br>WhatsApp / call: <a href="tel:+256778118580">0778118580</a></p></div>
</div></div></section>
</main>

<footer><div class="wrap"><p>&copy; 2026 Kahambu Foundation. Restoring hope, empowering lives and humanity.</p></div></footer>

<script>
var btns=document.querySelectorAll('.amounts button'),other=document.getElementById('other'),msg=document.getElementById('msg'),wa=document.getElementById('wa');
function pick(a){
  msg.textContent='Thank you! Your gift of $'+a+' will help a child with food, medicine, clothes, a bed or a wheelchair.';
  wa.href='https://wa.me/256778118580?text='+encodeURIComponent('Hello Kahambu Foundation, I would like to donate $'+a+'.');
}
btns.forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){
  btns.forEach(function(x){x.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false')});
  b.setAttribute('aria-pressed','true');other.value='';pick(b.dataset.a);
});});
other.addEventListener('input',function(){
  btns.forEach(function(x){x.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false')});
  if(other.value>0)pick(other.value);
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
